<title>USA: Eagle USA Airfreight Inc Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Eagle USA Airfreight Inc Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Pro forma shr	    $0.20		    $0.12</p>
<p> Net			  3,718		    2,630</p>
<p> Pro forma net	    3,718		    1,848</p>
<p> Revs			57,456		   34,606</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  18,312		   14,851</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Pro forma shr	    $0.66		    $0.51</p>
<p> Net			 12,426		   11,189</p>
<p> Pro forma net	   11,481		    7,507</p>
<p> Revs		     185,445		  126,214</p>
<p>Avg shrs diluted</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Periods ended September 30.</p>
<p>All share and earnings-per-share information reflect a two-for-one stock split in the form of a dividend that was payable August 1, 1996, to shareholders of record on July 24, 1996.</p>
<p>Pro forma figures reflect the full tax accrual on conversion from an S corporation. Its initial public offering was closed December 6, 1995.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
